<div class="calendar-system-visuals not-content">
  <figure class="system-range">
    <figcaption>
      <strong>Range model</strong>
      <span>Umm al-Qura is bounded by Taqwim's data. Civil and TBLA calculate dates in either direction.</span>
    </figcaption>

    <div class="range-axis" aria-hidden="true">
      <span>Earlier</span>
      <span>1924</span>
      <span>Today</span>
      <span>2077</span>
      <span>Later</span>
    </div>

    <dl class="range-rows">
      <div>
        <dt>Umm al-Qura</dt>
        <dd class="range-track">
          <span class="range-bar range-bar--bounded">1343–1500 AH</span>
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Islamic Civil</dt>
        <dd class="range-track">
          <span class="range-bar range-bar--proleptic">Proleptic arithmetic</span>
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Islamic TBLA</dt>
        <dd class="range-track">
          <span class="range-bar range-bar--proleptic">Proleptic arithmetic</span>
        </dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </figure>

  <figure class="system-epoch">
    <figcaption>
      <strong>Same fields, different epoch</strong>
      <span>Civil and TBLA use the same month and leap-year rules. Their starting day is different.</span>
    </figcaption>

    <div class="epoch-rows">
      <div class="epoch-row">
        <span class="epoch-date">1 Muharram 1 AH</span>
        <span class="epoch-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <span class="epoch-rule">TBLA · Thursday epoch</span>
        <span class="epoch-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <span class="epoch-result">18 July 622</span>
      </div>
      <div class="epoch-row">
        <span class="epoch-date">1 Muharram 1 AH</span>
        <span class="epoch-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <span class="epoch-rule">Civil · Friday epoch</span>
        <span class="epoch-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <span class="epoch-result">19 July 622</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="epoch-note">Gregorian dates are proleptic. For the same Hijri fields, TBLA resolves one day earlier than Civil.</p>
  </figure>
</div>

